      "text": "Un Bon Petit Soldat"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Stéphane Brizé’s taut exploration of the dynamics of power in the modern workplace features Alba Rohrwacher and Vincent Lindon at the top of their game."
